{"4450900":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Things Left Behind","steam_appid":4450900,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Things Left Behind<\/i> is a soft, narrative-driven, 2D indie game about the little moments of Queer and Disabled life, the ways our identities intersect, and the love, humor, tenderness, and care woven into our everyday experiences.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Told through a collection of intimate, playable slice-of-life vignettes, the game invites you into the worlds of Queer and Disabled characters as they navigate friendship, identity, intimacy, overwhelm, joy, and simply being together. These are stories drawn from our own lived experiences, woven together by a community of Queer and Disabled creators.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every level is its own little world, lovingly crafted by Queer and Disabled artists, writers, musicians, and game designers.<\/strong> Each vignette features its own distinct art style, original music, story, and interactive mechanics, reflecting the unique creative voices and experiences behind it. Some moments are funny, some are messy, some are vulnerable, and some are wonderfully ordinary. All are grounded in the ways we find care, connection, and belonging in one another.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than asking you to win, overcome, or fix anything, <i>The Things Left Behind<\/i> invites you to slow down, be present, and share in these small, meaningful moments of Queer and Disabled life.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Come Along With Us for Playable, Raw Moments<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through a child’s birthday party in <i>So Much World, All At Once<\/i> as sound builds and escape into their imagination to help them ground themselves as those that love them can be just a little too loud celebrating them… <i>Breathe in… Breathe out…<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a forest alongside two friends, sharing quiet conversations, discovering little trinkets, and finding joy in simply being together. As you wander, one friend, a transfemme individual subtly transitions in appearance. It's never announced or explained; it's simply a part of her life, embraced within the warmth and familiarity of their friendship. Through it all, their affection, honest conversations, and shared joys remain. <i>Do you think things will always be like this? <strong>What do you mean?<\/strong> Like… will things always get to be this way?<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/extras\/b4ad482757e79cd3932e366495c72fff.poster.avif?t=1793760234\" aria-label=\"an animated gif of two people walking in the woods. while they talk one person&#039;s appearance begins to change from masc to femme\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/extras\/b4ad482757e79cd3932e366495c72fff.webm?t=1793760234\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/extras\/b4ad482757e79cd3932e366495c72fff.mp4?t=1793760234\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the messy, meandering day of a transmasc person in <i>Harried<\/i>, where finding a little executive function is easier said than done. Try to tackle a seemingly endless list of tasks, get pulled into distractions, and watch as time slips away. Amid the frustration, unfinished chores, and small everyday struggles, find humor, tenderness, and comfort in the care of a loving partner. <i>Why did I let it get so bad in here…<\/i> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each story stands on its own, with distinct art styles, mechanics, and tone. Together, they form a growing collection of playable experiences grounded in lived reality.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed Around Care<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Narrative-driven 2D gameplay<br>• Short, self-contained vignette structure<br>• Dialogue and exploration-focused interaction<br>• Distinct art styles and mechanics per level<br>• No fail states, no score pressure<br>• Keyboard, mouse, and controller support<br>• Built in Unity<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Community-Centered Design Process<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Things Left Behind<\/i> is a game made <strong>by Queer and Disabled people, about Queer and Disabled lives, for anyone willing to spend a little time in our worlds.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Things Left Behind<\/i> is created through partnerships with disability and LGBTQIA2S+ organizations that support workforce development and inclusive creative practice. Collaborators are brought into the project from the beginning. Partners begin by learning Unity-based game development, contributing to design and narrative decisions, and participating in play-testing and iteration. This is not a game about marginalized communities made from the outside. It is a game co-designed and built by Queer and Disabled creators, with paid roles, mentorship, and shared authorship baked in from the beginning. Lived experience shapes every step of the game- from concept to completion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>These are our little stories. We're happy to share them with you.<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Things Left Behind<\/i> is a soft, narrative-driven, 2D indie game about the little moments of Queer and Disabled life, the ways our identities intersect, and the love, humor, tenderness, and care woven into our everyday experiences.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Told through a collection of intimate, playable slice-of-life vignettes, the game invites you into the worlds of Queer and Disabled characters as they navigate friendship, identity, intimacy, overwhelm, joy, and simply being together. These are stories drawn from our own lived experiences, woven together by a community of Queer and Disabled creators.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every level is its own little world, lovingly crafted by Queer and Disabled artists, writers, musicians, and game designers.<\/strong> Each vignette features its own distinct art style, original music, story, and interactive mechanics, reflecting the unique creative voices and experiences behind it. Some moments are funny, some are messy, some are vulnerable, and some are wonderfully ordinary. All are grounded in the ways we find care, connection, and belonging in one another.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than asking you to win, overcome, or fix anything, <i>The Things Left Behind<\/i> invites you to slow down, be present, and share in these small, meaningful moments of Queer and Disabled life.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Come Along With Us for Playable, Raw Moments<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through a child’s birthday party in <i>So Much World, All At Once<\/i> as sound builds and escape into their imagination to help them ground themselves as those that love them can be just a little too loud celebrating them… <i>Breathe in… Breathe out…<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a forest alongside two friends, sharing quiet conversations, discovering little trinkets, and finding joy in simply being together. As you wander, one friend, a transfemme individual subtly transitions in appearance. It's never announced or explained; it's simply a part of her life, embraced within the warmth and familiarity of their friendship. Through it all, their affection, honest conversations, and shared joys remain. <i>Do you think things will always be like this? <strong>What do you mean?<\/strong> Like… will things always get to be this way?<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/extras\/b4ad482757e79cd3932e366495c72fff.poster.avif?t=1793760234\" aria-label=\"an animated gif of two people walking in the woods. while they talk one person&#039;s appearance begins to change from masc to femme\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/extras\/b4ad482757e79cd3932e366495c72fff.webm?t=1793760234\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/extras\/b4ad482757e79cd3932e366495c72fff.mp4?t=1793760234\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the messy, meandering day of a transmasc person in <i>Harried<\/i>, where finding a little executive function is easier said than done. Try to tackle a seemingly endless list of tasks, get pulled into distractions, and watch as time slips away. Amid the frustration, unfinished chores, and small everyday struggles, find humor, tenderness, and comfort in the care of a loving partner. <i>Why did I let it get so bad in here…<\/i> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each story stands on its own, with distinct art styles, mechanics, and tone. Together, they form a growing collection of playable experiences grounded in lived reality.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed Around Care<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Narrative-driven 2D gameplay<br>• Short, self-contained vignette structure<br>• Dialogue and exploration-focused interaction<br>• Distinct art styles and mechanics per level<br>• No fail states, no score pressure<br>• Keyboard, mouse, and controller support<br>• Built in Unity<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Community-Centered Design Process<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Things Left Behind<\/i> is a game made <strong>by Queer and Disabled people, about Queer and Disabled lives, for anyone willing to spend a little time in our worlds.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Things Left Behind<\/i> is created through partnerships with disability and LGBTQIA2S+ organizations that support workforce development and inclusive creative practice. Collaborators are brought into the project from the beginning. Partners begin by learning Unity-based game development, contributing to design and narrative decisions, and participating in play-testing and iteration. This is not a game about marginalized communities made from the outside. It is a game co-designed and built by Queer and Disabled creators, with paid roles, mentorship, and shared authorship baked in from the beginning. Lived experience shapes every step of the game- from concept to completion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>These are our little stories. We're happy to share them with you.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Soft, narrative-driven 2D indie-queer game that explores the little moments of Disabled and Queer experiences and the intersections between. Our team has woven these stories together, drawing from our lived experiences.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/6b170be741b98c6f5c0cf5d35149e56f89e69d1e\/header.jpg?t=1793760234","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/ed647c29368aeaa672068426be9d6346b6ffe292\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793760234","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/ed647c29368aeaa672068426be9d6346b6ffe292\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793760234","website":"https:\/\/www.thethingsleftbehindgame.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated graphics (Intel HD 4000 or equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> N\/A<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Information Experience Lab"],"publishers":["Information Experience Lab"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":60,"description":"Gamepad Recommended"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/768c714e17e26c8401014db088fc33c3e5c72098\/ss_768c714e17e26c8401014db088fc33c3e5c72098.600x338.jpg?t=1793760234","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/768c714e17e26c8401014db088fc33c3e5c72098\/ss_768c714e17e26c8401014db088fc33c3e5c72098.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793760234"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/d299a58f676e8c5bcbe92dca6f9fbca11bdb8511\/ss_d299a58f676e8c5bcbe92dca6f9fbca11bdb8511.600x338.jpg?t=1793760234","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/d299a58f676e8c5bcbe92dca6f9fbca11bdb8511\/ss_d299a58f676e8c5bcbe92dca6f9fbca11bdb8511.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793760234"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/1f3c914873ebb4d0e9b2920c464f9815a91a9161\/ss_1f3c914873ebb4d0e9b2920c464f9815a91a9161.600x338.jpg?t=1793760234","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/1f3c914873ebb4d0e9b2920c464f9815a91a9161\/ss_1f3c914873ebb4d0e9b2920c464f9815a91a9161.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793760234"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/86ee095f9e28def65b6ef19c66eaf288149830a1\/ss_86ee095f9e28def65b6ef19c66eaf288149830a1.600x338.jpg?t=1793760234","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/86ee095f9e28def65b6ef19c66eaf288149830a1\/ss_86ee095f9e28def65b6ef19c66eaf288149830a1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793760234"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/925a519f32acef2dccb68312200246049a8338bf\/ss_925a519f32acef2dccb68312200246049a8338bf.600x338.jpg?t=1793760234","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/925a519f32acef2dccb68312200246049a8338bf\/ss_925a519f32acef2dccb68312200246049a8338bf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793760234"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/e1dea1149e3a60b86f618ef02fd7c90d7050b98d\/ss_e1dea1149e3a60b86f618ef02fd7c90d7050b98d.600x338.jpg?t=1793760234","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/e1dea1149e3a60b86f618ef02fd7c90d7050b98d\/ss_e1dea1149e3a60b86f618ef02fd7c90d7050b98d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793760234"},{"id":6,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/55d8dc8e5dd46679e43c1eb25f92c1ad2cb34a97\/ss_55d8dc8e5dd46679e43c1eb25f92c1ad2cb34a97.600x338.jpg?t=1793760234","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/55d8dc8e5dd46679e43c1eb25f92c1ad2cb34a97\/ss_55d8dc8e5dd46679e43c1eb25f92c1ad2cb34a97.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793760234"},{"id":7,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/65c6eb0dfe3e57562a79fa5186ee98124be96d47\/ss_65c6eb0dfe3e57562a79fa5186ee98124be96d47.600x338.jpg?t=1793760234","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/65c6eb0dfe3e57562a79fa5186ee98124be96d47\/ss_65c6eb0dfe3e57562a79fa5186ee98124be96d47.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793760234"},{"id":8,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/ce63721b1bf78c71961782a64cfade6613fa5909\/ss_ce63721b1bf78c71961782a64cfade6613fa5909.600x338.jpg?t=1793760234","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/ce63721b1bf78c71961782a64cfade6613fa5909\/ss_ce63721b1bf78c71961782a64cfade6613fa5909.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793760234"},{"id":9,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/37ebb5635bbdcb61b8fe7a8fa93d843f06398196\/ss_37ebb5635bbdcb61b8fe7a8fa93d843f06398196.600x338.jpg?t=1793760234","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/37ebb5635bbdcb61b8fe7a8fa93d843f06398196\/ss_37ebb5635bbdcb61b8fe7a8fa93d843f06398196.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793760234"},{"id":10,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/9cb6e0ab2b2d69710d022ef9a9e9d37e34f0e904\/ss_9cb6e0ab2b2d69710d022ef9a9e9d37e34f0e904.600x338.jpg?t=1793760234","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4450900\/9cb6e0ab2b2d69710d022ef9a9e9d37e34f0e904\/ss_9cb6e0ab2b2d69710d022ef9a9e9d37e34f0e904.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793760234"},{"id":11,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstat